    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/MarriageDialogueAlex",
      "key": "Rainy_Night_0",
      "field": null,
      "source": "Hey, did you have a good day? I'm sure tomorrow will be even better.$h",
      "translation": "Ahoj, jaký byl tvůj den? Zítra bude určitě ještě lepší.$h",
      "sourceSHA256": "7c2aa7d5aa149b1e2f3d26506ec15c5015c30ea289e988708f1e615431fbdcc6",
      "translationSHA256": "3718ddef302263a92d799d52e8a794bb8e65beb1d6fe347ab7d3d5a3d2a41a27",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/MarriageDialogueAlex",
      "key": "Rainy_Night_1",
      "field": null,
      "source": "How's it going? I've been carrying the old gridball around with me all day. A guy can pretend...$u",
      "translation": "Jak se vede? Celý den s sebou nosím starý míč na gridball. Aspoň můžu snít...$u",
      "sourceSHA256": "48c60956458cd323b2363bca9fe2f3fdd68aa719fa79c284a2e2411ce46f4728",
      "translationSHA256": "a9aa838b790101786c09b760dc56b175fea89a393ae5f692eb9e415bb54e122a",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/MarriageDialogueAlex",
      "key": "Rainy_Night_2",
      "field": null,
      "source": "Oh... the smell? I've been eating garlic all day. I'm trying to stay manly... Sorry.$l",
      "translation": "Ach... ten pach? Celý den jsem jedl česnek. Snažím se zůstat chlapákem... Promiň.$l",
      "sourceSHA256": "0b93025dfa263217efb141afef364e5c075d5aff701dc31aa825d62977afa2dd",
      "translationSHA256": "ed5cc7b546a55cf2a70a92541c00f2615fcb60f6f7761445831467bf15dc7bcc",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/MarriageDialogueAlex",
      "key": "Rainy_Night_3",
      "field": null,
      "source": "I've been setting aside a few scraps for Dusty. He deserves a treat now and then.",
      "translation": "Schovávám pár zbytků pro Dustyho. Čas od času si nějaký pamlsek zaslouží.",
      "sourceSHA256": "0a051fdde1058313ab96472f9e1162522b1e0168e61f81307a03d9859d8e390f",
      "translationSHA256": "00be899f6bbb6d1d0040ffc286b8a7269fd14f02bb69e96c36be1e1d94a5270a",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/MarriageDialogueAlex",
      "key": "Rainy_Night_4",
      "field": null,
      "source": "I was hungry so I made some dinner. Here, I saved you a plate. [241 242 225 214 198]$h",
      "translation": "Měl jsem hlad, tak jsem připravil večeři. Tady, nechal jsem ti porci. [241 242 225 214 198]$h",
      "sourceSHA256": "64d78b61bba8741e78a85d79df2be3b2d1ece1c5a4c93b88ac329739a3e7d4b2",
      "translationSHA256": "3f5ea6011a65804bb29813d7110837e88fa997c79202821b5e06c79093d21259",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/MarriageDialogueAlex",
      "key": "Indoor_Day_0",
      "field": null,
      "source": "Ahh... there's nothing like a good night's sleep next to my husband!$h^Ahh... there's nothing like a good night's sleep next to my wife!$h",
      "translation": "Ach... Není nad to pořádně se vyspat vedle svého manžela!$h^Ach... Není nad to pořádně se vyspat vedle své manželky!$h",
      "sourceSHA256": "6442531435df652d179f9e313081a9e19886c3c97708cfc19a2363d5f5958396",
      "translationSHA256": "b4941220324a8a7b19c8cfe7d2843045c66c583b787d8f94571de53a1ba9dc18",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/MarriageDialogueAlex",
      "key": "Indoor_Day_1",
      "field": null,
      "source": "Hey, honey! I made you a hot breakfast.[195 210 211]#$e#If you want to get strong, you have to eat like you mean it!",
      "translation": "Ahoj, zlato! Připravil jsem ti teplou snídani.[195 210 211]#$e#Pokud chceš zesílit, musíš pořádně jíst!",
      "sourceSHA256": "9c53211e7d6ff0bf7c3c3d1826be8db445ed731ae2ba53b7d665e4779d0efd29",
      "translationSHA256": "6ca06585dcf6c3b3d3d99232ea512228c65d022ed5da718097e2f298e26b556c",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/MarriageDialogueAlex",
      "key": "Indoor_Day_2",
      "field": null,
      "source": "Come here. *squeeze*... Mmhmm. You're firming up from all that farm work.",
      "translation": "Pojď sem. *stisknutí*... Mhm. Všechna ta práce na farmě ti zpevňuje tělo.",
      "sourceSHA256": "d401a0bc5ea6dd0a753599ac390196c639ff4bcf362ea5c15f696d863503072f",
      "translationSHA256": "f33459ae71c188b27d0afcd7cf54eb973ab92f2035faec3d1fa22d17dbf5b02f",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/MarriageDialogueAlex",
      "key": "Indoor_Day_3",
      "field": null,
      "source": "I'm still getting used to cooking and doing laundry... It's not exactly my favorite, but I knew what I was getting into when I married you.$h",
      "translation": "Pořád si zvykám na vaření a praní... Není to zrovna moje oblíbená činnost, ale když jsem si tě bral, věděl jsem, do čeho jdu.$h",
      "sourceSHA256": "92a8223c5cc557081ce561cf4a402d296bfc8e7aeca5738c3c698b338b573af0",
      "translationSHA256": "cfb349e5b02344791bad1f362fd7dd242f1df8577544170703be32947eb1664b",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/MarriageDialogueAlex",
      "key": "Indoor_Day_4",
      "field": null,
      "source": "There's a couple things around the house that I'm going to try and fix today. Don't worry about me, I'm not bored.",
      "translation": "Dnes se pokusím opravit pár věcí v domě. Neměj o mě strach, nenudím se.",
      "sourceSHA256": "d1d11a9c0fa5255cf818f1e2e690a9eaad8da11b2ff24b746f8c72429fa93f46",
      "translationSHA256": "97415fffd0242f0a0acda92a4abfd73752bdc75ee626906f9463468e6711a777",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/MarriageDialogueAlex",
      "key": "Indoor_Night_0",
      "field": null,
      "source": "It feels good to push yourself to the limit, doesn't it? You'll really feel like you earned your place in the soft bed tonight.",
      "translation": "Je příjemné vydat ze sebe úplně všechno, nemyslíš? Dnes večer si tu měkkou postel opravdu zasloužíš.",
      "sourceSHA256": "91031ad3cdc2e26ca234109bb7d3621399afd0f4c7b31124fdc043c5e72fb4bf",
      "translationSHA256": "a7c7909c4e9757dd3ca696ab236e5141b20a0727ca29bea180ee34d7e1f43368",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/MarriageDialogueAlex",
      "key": "Indoor_Night_1",
      "field": null,
      "source": "Did you get a haircut or something? You're looking pretty good today. Maybe it's all that fresh air...$l",
      "translation": "Nějaký nový účes nebo tak něco? Dnes ti to moc sluší. Možná za to může všechen ten čerstvý vzduch...$l",
      "sourceSHA256": "ccd92e5518250635b673ae90457ad83ae7f70b9592b44fec1e2c31d7e8542fcd",
      "translationSHA256": "f11934dc653eb6b61fe91b1103ac94da9049fe893bcf44f5519f78a30fbdbd77",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/MarriageDialogueAlex",
      "key": "Indoor_Night_2",
      "field": null,
      "source": "Tell me all about your day. It's good to get everything off your chest now and then.",
      "translation": "Pověz mi všechno o svém dni. Čas od času je dobré dostat ze sebe všechno, co člověka tíží.",
      "sourceSHA256": "af190f6fafa4bbd547c878845da7b68beeca42db2cbae3492cf55a651b8e4fae",
      "translationSHA256": "ce21360079b43312648236f149180360fc6da7f74fd1538e31be5606bf1957c8",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/MarriageDialogueAlex",
      "key": "Indoor_Night_3",
      "field": null,
      "source": "Hey... I got some new shorts. I thought you might be interested to know...$l",
      "translation": "Ahoj... Mám nové kraťasy. Napadlo mě, že by tě to mohlo zajímat...$l",
      "sourceSHA256": "762917324010463bb4ae6ce9b5218f2e27759ef2660428066686719a4e7eb644",
      "translationSHA256": "e997871019310b1980271b7baed0684fcb49e93f13d5bc10b70402ce6c60fa2d",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/MarriageDialogueAlex",
      "key": "Indoor_Night_4",
      "field": null,
      "source": "If you need some quiet time to yourself, that's okay with me.",
      "translation": "Jestli potřebuješ chvíli klidu o samotě, mně to nevadí.",
      "sourceSHA256": "f5d69c30762675748a65e1eab3f170ad4618bdf3128e0d432dada1b56af60e6b",
      "translationSHA256": "002acb556a0b450feab9110eefaef6ed3e2c3ee7246a1750b6eb132739d84ae0",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/MarriageDialogueAlex",
      "key": "Outdoor_0",
      "field": null,
      "source": "Hey. When I stand here and look out over our land... I'm really proud. You've done great work.",
      "translation": "Ahoj. Když tu stojím a dívám se na naše pozemky... Jsem opravdu hrdý. Farma je díky tobě úžasná.",
      "sourceSHA256": "45ffc5017bc1080da69002b6ea0ab7e03758d54c8b3716fe938f83b20d5e4da4",
      "translationSHA256": "b120bb05a3243e9d3226b1e86547f8e95691690382acef61881ed535b6e138fc",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/MarriageDialogueAlex",
      "key": "Outdoor_1",
      "field": null,
      "source": "This is a great place to raise children. I would've loved growing up in a place like this. So much room to run around!",
      "translation": "Tohle je skvělé místo pro výchovu dětí. Moc by se mi líbilo vyrůstat na takovém místě. Je tu tolik prostoru na běhání!",
      "sourceSHA256": "7dc4eec06632d1ad22e18f98b6ac74dc0c9c89edcbe4584aff9327cdf8b1d313",
      "translationSHA256": "22e12890e8111f2073132fc2797894f9095f1f00c9d2899164c7bc0f847fd912",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/MarriageDialogueAlex",
      "key": "Outdoor_2",
      "field": null,
      "source": "I like to spend as much time outside as possible. It just feels better to be out here.",
      "translation": "Rád trávím venku co nejvíc času. Tady venku je mi prostě lépe.",
      "sourceSHA256": "3cacd7bcd8ee04d4f8135741249cfce3606f3d438a99875638e338caf8af9de7",
      "translationSHA256": "2eb92878e601f8545223a1b3da786238733a9bdccd218763e916507e400da59e",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/MarriageDialogueAlex",
      "key": "Outdoor_3",
      "field": null,
      "source": "Look at us, with our little farm. We make a cute couple.$h^Hey. Maybe it's the golden light, but you look beautiful today.$l",
      "translation": "Jen se na nás podívej, máme vlastní malou farmu. Jsme roztomilý pár.$h^Ahoj. Možná je to tím zlatavým světlem, ale dnes jsi nádherná.$l",
      "sourceSHA256": "944d44d6c1fc7e902565394f1ab6acffc0764ba44ae7704cd30ee7d0bf1a375f",
      "translationSHA256": "6a270dcf835d10e09e8ffd8ed20a607fa49e3cc6d9405ab1ac3d3c7e220bc102",
